<section class="kf-about">
  <div class="kf-about-glow"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="kf-about-hero">
      <span class="kf-eyebrow">ABOUT KITCHIFIX</span>
      <h1>Making everyday kitchens<br><em>better, one smart solution at a time.</em></h1>
      <p>KitchiFix is a modern kitchen essentials brand focused on practical, thoughtfully selected products that make everyday cooking, organizing and kitchen tasks easier.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="kf-intro">
      <div>
        <span class="kf-eyebrow">WHAT WE DO</span>
        <h2>We don't just sell kitchen products.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>We discover, curate and deliver useful kitchen solutions for real everyday needs. Our goal is simple: find products that solve small frustrations, add convenience and earn their place in your home.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="kf-story-grid">
      <div class="kf-story-card kf-featured"><span>01</span><h2>Discover</h2><p>We pay attention to everyday kitchen problems and the small tasks that could be made easier.</p></div>
      <div class="kf-story-card"><span>02</span><h2>Curate</h2><p>We select practical, useful and thoughtfully designed products instead of simply filling a store with random trends.</p></div>
      <div class="kf-story-card"><span>03</span><h2>Simplify</h2><p>Our aim is to make cooking, organizing and everyday kitchen routines feel simpler and more convenient.</p></div>
      <div class="kf-story-card"><span>04</span><h2>Deliver</h2><p>We build a clear, professional shopping experience from discovering a product to receiving it at your door.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="kf-values">
      <div><span class="kf-eyebrow">WHO WE SERVE</span><h2>For people who want a kitchen that works<br><em>better.</em></h2><p class="kf-lead">Whether you love cooking, want a more organized space or simply want everyday kitchen tasks to take less effort, KitchiFix is built around practical solutions for modern homes.</p></div>
      <div class="kf-value-list">
        <div><b>01</b><strong>Practical first</strong><p>Products are selected around usefulness and the problems they can solve.</p></div>
        <div><b>02</b><strong>Thoughtful selection</strong><p>We focus on useful kitchen essentials rather than unnecessary complexity.</p></div>
        <div><b>03</b><strong>Simple shopping</strong><p>Clear products, straightforward navigation and an easy buying experience.</p></div>
        <div><b>04</b><strong>Customer first</strong><p>We care about building a store experience based on clarity, trust and support.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kf-mission">
      <span class="kf-eyebrow">OUR VISION</span>
      <h2>Thoughtful tools.<br><em>Beautifully simple.</em></h2>
      <p>Our vision is to build KitchiFix into a trusted kitchen brand where customers can discover useful, practical and thoughtfully selected products without unnecessary complexity.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="kf-about-cta"><span class="kf-eyebrow">WELCOME TO KITCHIFIX</span><h2>Your kitchen,<br><em>only better.</em></h2><a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="kf-btn">Explore the collection <span>→</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
